{"reviewId": "366239284_7Yf0awNTe", "review": {"abstract": "从萧条向回升的过渡是缓慢且漫长的，要经历10年以上的时间，其间我们可能会看到一些新兴经济体的复兴，比如20世纪80年代至90年代的亚洲四小龙，它们的复兴就发生在第五次康波的回升阶段", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 6, "content": "2008年经济危机，确认转入衰退。2015年的第二次冲击，进入萧条，国内通缩成为共识，商品价格低。2015-2024刚好10年，符合回升的时间条件。加上人工智能新技术的出现，提高生产效率，技术创新推动的条件也已经具备。中美博弈的大背景在持续发生变化，时间的天平已向中国倾斜。\n期待2025以后中国的发展。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "5424-5514", "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "366239284_7Yf0awNTe", "userVid": 366239284, "topics": [], "createTime": 1740529775, "userEditTime": 1743980522, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 366239284, "name": "孔春梅", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELWibGvkcL9YBZgrtw8icsnV6c0AhgwHcRiba3JvgX84yQn5mTXCs7yFm7wKNouVzibUXaReTxo9yMMA4jmHd0M0hPQsVR1Z8KY4p9ANzjUCZt47A/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241216-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 39, "likes": [{"userVid": 423128041, "name": "Passion", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELTcYKaOib12AGsWXOEz75Ot9TMqgNnj81FUgxHRSoezPCUOrqjdWCk0zVvaJic85ldy9ah4Qn6XXZrh29FSZ1VUgfeBhJcib6lSLdho9dPumpPw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deep